Quick check
Why can’t Chrome directly write to your hard disk?
If an app in user mode crashes, does the whole computer crash?

Answers: 1) Apps run in user mode, which has no direct hardware access, so Chrome must make a system call and let the kernel do it. 2) No, only that app crashes. The kernel keeps running.
